license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.3.0
date-released: 2026-08-04
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 formalization from positional quotient-residue geometry and carry
  mass to quadratic amplitude rigidity and one native centered-bracket
  operator. Real pairs and complex numbers are proved faithful coordinates of
  the same mass-built state and resultant, with the same zero locus; sigma is
  isolated as an
  ambient quadratic-norm deformation coordinate.
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - formalized mathematics
  - positional representation
  - carry geometry
  - centered differences
  - quadratic amplitude
  - native operator-zero predicate
  - reproducible proof audit
